<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmen industry output 26.6 pct up in Jan-Nov '96.</title>
<headline>Turkmen industry output 26.6 pct up in Jan-Nov '96.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAD 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's industrial production rose 26.6 percent in the first 11 months of 1996 compared to the same period in 1995, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> TURKMEN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   JAN-NOV 96  JAN-OCT 96  JAN-NOV 95</p>
<p> yr/yr percent change	     +26.6	 +25.3	 n/a</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
